    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d246-a1">

                <pb facs="0358" n="246" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg246"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Minister in Panama</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Price</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-03-04T15:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 4, 1918, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department does not feel that Volio or his associates may properly be forbidden
                    the right to leave the Republic of Panama, if they depart as individuals, and
                    without those attributes which under American law would cause them to be
                    regarded as an expedition</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
